{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 20, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人性", "id": "人性"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "內", "id": "內"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "戕賊", "id": "戕賊"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "杞柳", "id": "杞柳"}, {"form": "桮棬", "id": "桮棬"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "舍", "id": "舍"}, {"form": "路", "id": "路"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.5212136790192612, "source": "桮棬", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.6198259676873707, "source": "桮棬", "target": "人性"}, {"weight": 1.0793809267402221, "source": "桮棬", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.495294705041271, "source": "桮棬", "target": "杞柳"}, {"weight": 2.6198259676873707, "source": "桮棬", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 3.312973148247316, "source": "桮棬", "target": "戕賊"}, {"weight": 1.995671658614377, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.5552874465497997, "source": "智", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 3.9415818076696905, "source": "智", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.7443572303334711, "source": "智", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.6888188391743224, "source": "信", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.4375044108934163, "source": "信", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.3388921222253067, "source": "義", "target": "人性"}, {"weight": 1.8778886229579936, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.8280664984593159, "source": "義", "target": "杞柳"}, {"weight": 1.3388921222253067, "source": "義", "target": "戕賊"}, {"weight": 1.3388921222253067, "source": "義", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.4566751578816903, "source": "義", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.52121367901926